## 2. `HydrationStore` — `Sources/AlmanacCore/Hydration/HydrationStore.swift`

Public API surface, matching the shapes already used (`LabStore.record`/`upsertReport`, `NutritionCatalog.addPortion`, `HealthSampleStore.apply`):

